        {"zh": "我比岩石更坚硬！", "en": "I'm harder than stone!"},
        {"zh": "撞击只能增强我！", "en": "Collisions only strengthen me!"},
        {"zh": "我的力量无法被阻挡！", "en": "My strength cannot be stopped!"},
        {"zh": "轰隆轰隆，粉碎一切！", "en": "Crushing everything, boom boom!"},
        {"zh": "你不够资格与我相碰！", "en": "You're not worthy to collide with me!"},
        {"zh": "我六条腿压住地，你撞得像撞山。", "en": "My six legs brace the ground; you strike me like a cliff."}
      ]
    },
